title
bromochlorofluoromethane RDKit ETKDGv3 MMFF94

#
# NB: Class I directives (e.g. memory, multiplicity, charge etc) go here
#
# For more information see: http://www.cfs.dl.ac.uk/docs/index.shtml
#

geometry angstrom
    -0.21511104     -1.13114761     -0.82351157   9   F
    -0.05845127     -0.11760153      0.06473953   6   C
    -1.28216178      1.12009056     -0.21510388  17  Cl
     1.71462931      0.64262343     -0.10423079  35  Br
    -0.15890522     -0.51396484      1.07810672   1   H
end


basis 6-31G

#
# NB: Class II directives go here
#
# To perform a dft calculation with b3lyp and medium quadrature uncomment the below
# dft b3lyp
# dft quadrature medium
#

runtype scf

enter
